With free My lifecell app lifecell subscribers are able to conveniently control their expenses and manage their mobile number. In "Shake&Win" section you can win gigabytes of data traffic, free minutes, SMS, and other useful gifts. Don’t miss!
With My lifecell app you are able to:
- check the details of your mobile number, control main and bonus account;
- add several own numbers and numbers of your relatives, and manage them;
- receive detailed information about the balance of minutes, SMS, mobile traffic;
- view information about your tariff plan and change it to new more convenient tariff;
- top up your mobile account and accounts of your relatives without commission;
- activate and deactivate additional services;
- view information about expenses and mobile account top-ups;
- win gifts in "Shake&Win" section and receive special offers in "My Rewards" section;
- see the addresses of the nearest lifecell stores;
- contact support in a convenient way and much more.
Join millions of lifecell customers who already use My lifecell app!
